WHAT THIS LICENCE DOES NOT COVER

No benchmark item text is redistributed here. data/item_manifest.csv carries
identifiers only (item_id, source dataset, source item key, tier, subset
membership and answer index); question stems and answer options are not
included, and neither are the reference answer strings, which were removed
from data/raw/ before publication.

The source benchmarks keep their own licences and must be obtained from their
original distributors:

  ARC-Challenge   CC BY-SA 4.0   https://allenai.org/data/arc
  MMLU            MIT            https://github.com/hendrycks/test
  ChemBench       MIT            https://github.com/lamalab-org/chem-bench

code/build_items.py reconstructs the exact item set from those sources using
the identifiers in data/item_manifest.csv and the seed recorded in the paper.
